  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes Privacy-Preserving Quantum Federated Learning (PQFL) using parameterized quantum circuits, quantum homomorphic encryption, and quantum differential privacy. In simulation, centralized QML reached 91.4% accuracy, PQFL without QDP reached 90.1%, and PQFL with QDP reached 88.7% with privacy loss ε = 1.2 and communication overhead rising from 850 KB to 920 KB and 960 KB. Qubit utilization was reported as 75%, 72%, and 70% for the three configurations, respectively.",
